✅Sum of Binary Tree
Given a binary tree, find the sum of values of all the nodes. 

Examples:
Input: root = [10, 20, 30, 40, 60, N, N]
           10
         /   \
        20    30
      /    \
    40     60
Output: 160

class Solution {
    static int sumBT(Node root) {
        if(root == null){
            return 0;
        }
        int x = sumBT(root.left);
        int y = sumBT(root.right);
        
        return(x + y + root.data);
    }
}
